"Pixel), а не в Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:3
msgid "Link tracker"
msgstr "Відстежувач посилання"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:5
msgid ""
"The link tracker allow you to create tracked links to measure your marketing "
"campaigns' effectiveness. They let you determine which channels bring you "
"the most visitors and make informed decisions."
msgstr ""
"Sledování odkazů vám umožňuje vytvářet sledované odkazy pro měření "
"efektivity vašich marketingových kampaní. Umožňují určit, které kanály vám "
"přinášejí nejvíce návštěvníků, a činit informovaná rozhodnutí."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:12
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Link Tracker` module is not installed by default. You need to "
"enable the :guilabel:`Email Marketing` option by going "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings.` Alternatively, "
"you can :doc:`install <../../../general/apps_modules>` the :guilabel:`Link "
"Tracker` module itself or one of the marketing apps."
msgstr ""
"Modul :guilabel:`Sledování odkazů` není nainstalován ve výchozím nastavení. "
"Musíte povolit možnost :guilabel:`E-mailový marketing` přechodem "
"na :menuselection:`Web --> Konfigurace --> Nastavení.` Alternativně "
"můžete :doc:`nainstalovat <../../../general/apps_modules>` samotný "
"modul :guilabel:`Sledování odkazů` nebo některou z marketingových aplikací."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:18
msgid "Create a traceable URL"
msgstr "Vytvoření sledovatelné URL adresy"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:20
msgid ""
"To create and manage tracked links, navigate to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Site --> Link Tracker`. Fill in the following information and "
"click :guilabel:`Get tracked link` to generate a tracking URL."
msgstr ""
"Pro vytváření a správu sledovaných odkazů přejděte na :menuselection:`Web --"
"> Web --> Sledování odkazů`. Vyplňte následující informace a klikněte "
"na :guilabel:`Získat sledovaný odkaz` pro vygenerování sledovací URL adresy."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:23
msgid ""
":guilabel:`URL`: The URL which is the target of the campaign. It is "
"automatically populated with the URL from where you access the menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`URL`: Adresa URL, která je cílem kampaně. Je automaticky vyplněna "
"URL adresou, ze které přistupujete k nabídce."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Campaign`: The specific campaign the link should be associated "
"with. This parameter is used to distinguish the different campaigns."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Кампанія`: конкретна кампанія, з якою має бути пов'язане "
"посилання. Цей параметр використовується для розрізнення різних кампаній."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:29
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Medium`: The medium describes the category or method through "
"which the visitor arrives at your site, such as organic search, paid search, "
"social media ad, email, etc."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Канал`: канал описує категорію або метод, за допомогою якого "
"відвідувач потрапляє на ваш сайт, наприклад органічний пошук, платний пошук, "
"реклама в соціальних мережах, електронна пошта тощо."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Source`: The source identifies the precise platform or website "
"that referred the visitor, such as a search engine, a newsletter, or a "
"website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Zdroj`: Zdroj identifikuje přesnou platformu nebo webovou "
"stránku, která návštěvníka odkázala, například vyhledávač, newsletter nebo "
"webovou stránku."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:None
msgid "Create a link tracker URL"
msgstr "Створення URL-адреси відстеження посилань"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:38
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Campaign`, :guilabel:`Medium`, and :guilabel:`Source` are "
"called :abbr:`UTM (Urchin Tracking Module)` parameters. They are "
"incorporated in the tracked URL."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kampaň`, :guilabel:`Médium` a :guilabel:`Zdroj` se nazývají "
"parametry :abbr:`UTM (Urchin Tracking Module)`. Jsou začleněny do sledované "
"URL adresy."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:42
msgid "Website visibility"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:44
msgid ""
"You can use the :abbr:`UTM (Urchin Tracking Module)` parameters to hide or "
"show building blocks for specific audiences. To achieve this, click "
"the :guilabel:`Edit` button on your website, select a building block, go to "
"the :guilabel:`Customize` tab, scroll down to :guilabel:`Visibility`, and "
"click :guilabel:`Conditionally`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:None
msgid ""
"Use the conditional visibility to display site elements to specific "
"audiences."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:52
msgid ""
"For each parameter available in the :ref:`Visibility <building_blocks/"
"visibility>` section, you can choose :guilabel:`Visible for` "
"or :guilabel:`Hidden for` and select the record you want from the dropdown "
"list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:57
msgid "Tracked links overview"
msgstr "Огляд відстежуваних посилань"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:59
msgid ""
"To get an overview of your tracked links, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Site --> Link Tracker` and scroll down to :guilabel:`Your tracked links` "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Щоб отримати огляд ваших відстежуваних посилань, перейдіть "
"до :menuselection:`Вебсайт --> Сайт --> Відстеження посилань` і прокрутіть "
"вниз до розділу :guilabel:`Ваші відстежувані посилання`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:None
msgid "Get an overview of all the links you track."
msgstr "Отримайте огляд усіх посилань, які ви відстежуєте."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:66
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "Статистика"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:68
msgid ""
"To measure the performance of tracked links, click the :guilabel:`Stats` "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Pro měření výkonu sledovaných odkazů klikněte na "
"tlačítko :guilabel:`Statistiky`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:None
msgid "View the statistics related to a specific tracked link."
msgstr "Zobrazení statistik souvisejících s konkrétním sledovaným odkazem."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:73
msgid ""
"Scroll down to the :guilabel:`Statistics` section to get an overview of the "
"number of clicks of your tracked links. You can display information for a "
"specific period by clicking the :guilabel:`All Time`, :guilabel:`Last "
"Month`, or :guilabel:`Last Week` options."
msgstr ""
"Přejděte dolů do sekce :guilabel:`Statistiky` a získejte přehled o počtu "
"kliknutí na vaše sledované odkazy. Můžete zobrazit informace pro konkrétní "
"období kliknutím na možnosti :guilabel:`Celou dobu`, :guilabel:`Minulý "
"měsíc` nebo :guilabel:`Minulý týden`."

